WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Carlos Ibarra: The pilot moving one sub-assembly step to Station 3 brought the bottleneck within two seconds of takt.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Grace Liu: Operators adapted quickly, no complaints on the new station layout.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Theo Marsh: Let's extend the pilot for one more week before making it permanent.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Carlos Ibarra: I'll track throughput daily and bring final numbers to next week's review.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Theo Marsh: If it holds, let's plan the rollout to Line 1 as well.
